WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
The leader of North Korea

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.085
just pledged its undying

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.169
support for Russia

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.129
and what

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:06.047
he calls the “sacred war”

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.132
that Russia is fighting

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:07.882
against the West.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:08.800
Yes, he literally called

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.676
it “sacred.”

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.468
So Russia and North

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:12.095
Korea are becoming besties,

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.638
which is just another example

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:14.973
of the recalibration

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:15.557
that is happening

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:16.433
in the global order.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:16.766
There's this

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:17.767
growing rebellion

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.852
against the U.S.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.103
led Western order.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:20.729
And Russia

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.646
is kind of leading

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.147
the charge

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.189
here, teaming up

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.524
with another outcast,

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.316
North Korea,

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:27.193
to condemn the West and say

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:27.569
it's time

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.862
to build a different order

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.988
away from the United States.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:30.613
As they do this,

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:31.031
they continue

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:31.906
to frame this all

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.491
as very existential,

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:35.118
like Putin called his fight

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:35.952
against Ukraine

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.203
“sacred” recently.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.121
And here's Kim

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.497
echoing the same sentiment.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.790
This polarizing language,

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.833
makes it clear that

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.084
this tension between

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.502
the West and its enemies

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:45.462
is heating up.

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:45.795
If you want to

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:46.629
better understand global

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:47.797
politics, follow for more.

